  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "Mix components thoroughly, adjust pH to 7.0 and autoclave under a N2 gas atmosphere. After cooling, aseptically and anaerobically add the following solutions from anaerobic stocks (autoclaved or *filter-sterilized):"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": "Distribute the medium into culture vessels (e.g., 20 ml in Balch tubes) and seal with butyl rubber stoppers."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "comment": "Comment: JCM 32405 may grow better in a modified medium by the addition of 20 mM sodium lactate and 50 μM Fe(III)•EDTA instead of casamino acids and ferric quinate. However, formation of magnetosomes in cells may be inhibited in the modified medium."
    }
  ]
}